      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "The token pack contains the following:\n<ul><li>1HP, 5HP, and 10HP tokens (same as the ones included in the Enhanced Edition box)</li><li>+1 damage and -1 damage tokens (same as EE)</li><li>Start of turn/end of turn tokens (NOT included in EE)</li></ul>\nSo I guess the only reason to buy it is for the start/end tokens, unless you find you desperately need more of the others. I made my own start/end tokens and they are really helpful to stop you forgetting effects that are easy to miss when you skim the cards.\n\nI also have Spiff&#39;s [url=http://www.spiffworld.com/sotm/files/universal_effects.pdf]Universal Effects Tracker[/url] which can cut down the number of tokens you need in play quite a lot, and makes everything neater.\n\nHope that helps!\n",
